WEBVTT

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.021
(Peter) So where exactly
do you think you saw Aslan?
你认为
你是在哪看到亚斯蓝的？

00:00:21.606 --> 00:00:24.693
I wish you'd all stop trying
to sound like grown-ups.
你们别再装大人的口气讲话了

00:00:24.776 --> 00:00:28.071
I don't think I saw him,
I did see him.
不是我认为 我是真的看到他

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.658
I am a grown-up.
我就是大人

00:00:31.742 --> 00:00:33.910
It was right over...
就在

00:00:33.994 --> 00:00:35.746
- (screaming)
- Lucy!
露西！

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:42.794
...here.
这里

00:01:31.843 --> 00:01:34.388
(Susan whispering)
Lucy, are you awake?
露西 你睡了吗？

00:01:34.471 --> 00:01:36.139
Hmm...
露西 你睡了吗？

00:01:40.352 --> 00:01:42.521
Why do you think I didn't see Aslan?
你想为什么我看不见亚斯蓝？

00:01:47.692 --> 00:01:49.694
You believe me?
你相信我？

00:01:49.778 --> 00:01:52.697
Well, we got across the gorge.
我们通过了峡谷

00:01:55.867 --> 00:01:57.452
I don't know.
我不知道

00:01:59.371 --> 00:02:01.873
Maybe you didn't really want to.
也许你并不想看见

00:02:05.794 --> 00:02:08.547
You always knew we'd be
coming back here, didn't you?
你一直都知道我们会回来
对吗？

00:02:09.172 --> 00:02:10.924
I hoped so.
我希望如此

00:02:15.178 --> 00:02:19.850
I finally just got used
to the idea of being in England.
我终于习惯呆在英国的事实了

00:02:19.933 --> 00:02:22.352
But you're happy
to be here, aren't you?
不过你高兴回来这里 对吗？

00:02:24.229 --> 00:02:26.398
While it lasts.
不知道还能高兴多久

00:02:48.628 --> 00:02:51.673
(soft growling)

00:02:58.096 --> 00:03:00.390
(soft growling)

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.668
(laughter)

00:04:18.969 --> 00:04:23.765
(soft growling)

00:04:31.565 --> 00:04:33.316
(soft voice) Lucy.
露西

00:04:36.528 --> 00:04:38.405
Lucy.
露西

00:04:46.997 --> 00:04:49.040
Aslan!
亚斯蓝！

00:04:59.217 --> 00:05:01.886
I've missed you so much!
我好想你

00:05:05.515 --> 00:05:08.018
- You've grown.
- Every year you grow...
你变大了
你每长大一岁

00:05:08.101 --> 00:05:10.145
...so shall I.
我也会大一些

00:05:12.022 --> 00:05:16.276
Where have you been?
Why haven't you come to help us?
你跑去哪了？
你为什么没来帮我们？

00:05:16.359 --> 00:05:20.572
Things never happen
the same way twice, dear one.
同样的事情不会发生两次

00:05:21.239 --> 00:05:23.199
(cracking)

00:05:28.538 --> 00:05:31.875
- Susan! Wake up!
- Huh?
苏珊！醒醒！

00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:37.631
Certainly, Lu.
Whatever you like.
没问题 露露 你想怎样都行

00:05:37.714 --> 00:05:39.966
(twig snapping)

